	(text "36 V protected terminal input, vertical | series diode, TPS1HTC100 high-side switch, instrument taps" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e51ade57-566c-5107-a41a-cade6ae510a5"))
	(text "Protected and electronically switched 36 V high-voltage input front end on a VERTICAL, top-entry 2-position 5.08 mm pluggable terminal block — Phoenix MSTBVA 2,5/2-G-5,08, OW-CONN-TBH-1X02-5P08-VERT, on the local orb_weaver_tht copy of the MSTBVA footprint — with a SBRT15U50SP5 reverse-polarity series diode and a TPS1HTC100-Q1 smart high-side switch providing adjustable current limit, inrush/soft-start control, analog load-current sense," (at 15.24 21.082 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2cb034bf-28e3-57fe-ba49-ea484966ed4d"))
	(text "thermal shutdown, and an integrated inductive discharge clamp." (at 15.24 23.782 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "135dee9b-adda-543b-9826-e09ba63f1f11"))
	(text "Matching net labels are connected. Group order explains function; PCB placement priorities are stated below." (at 15.24 29.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e79543fa-c42e-5861-9a5a-a2e6f4da6fca"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 15.24 39.182) (xy 211.88 39.182)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "74b305d6-1e1f-51a5-86a5-14ce368cb0aa"))
	(text "1. Entry and reverse-polarity protection" (at 15.24 41.722 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb0b1d36-89eb-5023-a9f9-a91bebb21d01"))
	(text "${edd8ca6e-95e5-4890-b15e-f0b0125b7404:REFERENCE} brings the external 36 V supply onto HV_RAW (pin 2) and GND (pin 1); ${6584037a-df5c-481c-be6d-17e3e430d517:REFERENCE} in series passes it to HV_IN and blocks a reversed supply." (at 15.24 45.872 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4a10f47f-5b96-532b-915d-19189d3f0f80"))
	(text "36 V entry, 2-pos 5.08 mm" (at 20.32 76.576 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8013ce43-93d4-5db7-852a-a9fb6fa2ccb4"))
	(text "vertical" (at 20.32 79.116 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6ba0164c-a3c3-543a-b16f-d48d31d6ae18"))
	(text "PLACE: ${edd8ca6e-95e5-4890-b15e-f0b0125b7404:REFERENCE}'s footprint has pin 1 at its origin (the horizontal part's is 10 mm off its pads), its pads are 2.08 x 3.6 mm on a 1.4 mm drill, and its courtyard reaches 5.3 mm inboard of" (at 15.24 84.196 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6f4cebc9-f929-59f9-b552-7cc38e2bdee1"))
	(text "pin 1, so leave that room behind it. Do not rotate it 180 degrees to turn the entry around; pin order would swap GND and the supply in board space." (at 15.24 86.736 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "42a20333-cb15-54a0-9176-4fad793699db"))
	(text "PLACE: Keep ${6584037a-df5c-481c-be6d-17e3e430d517:REFERENCE} close to ${edd8ca6e-95e5-4890-b15e-f0b0125b7404:REFERENCE} so HV_RAW stays short; the whole supply current flows through ${6584037a-df5c-481c-be6d-17e3e430d517:REFERENCE}, so give its PowerDI 5 pad copper on both sides for heat." (at 15.24 90.546 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7baa1bf-f7bd-5a98-902c-d7bc43a9c77f"))
	(text "ROUTE: HV_RAW is the PWR_HV_ENTRY class (0.5 mm clearance) and HV_IN PWR_HV_LOCAL; size the copper for the full supply current and keep the GND return beside the supply path from the" (at 15.24 94.356 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "75a720ee-bb07-5025-9f3e-91dc40ae3c41"))
	(text "terminal onward." (at 15.24 96.896 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cfd8129a-07c7-55c2-94b8-b37199b408ca"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 219.5 39.182) (xy 416.14 39.182)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0a51bbd3-6466-57a6-9e67-f5e7caa3b70c"))
	(text "2. High-side switch, input bypass, current limit and output" (at 219.5 41.722 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7f7fb0d2-fcce-5b9c-9c08-67d920ef42ad"))
	(text "${709c3d68-6a22-41fe-bb8f-1b3c74efa230:REFERENCE} bypasses HV_IN at the VS pins (12-14); ${fc7d50ec-17b6-455e-92c7-d4ac9f6e233b:REFERENCE} passes HV_IN to +36V when EN is high; ${ccedec14-0e0a-4e56-bdc4-483a87378948:REFERENCE} on ILIM (pin 7) sets the current limit; ${5c7b0e5f-9255-431b-ba8e-9839802417b5:REFERENCE} holds the switched output." (at 219.5 45.872 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dae9cb4e-917c-5629-9bb2-29c0c6b4c48b"))
	(text "Smart high-side switch, analog current sense" (at 224.58 203.884592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1a9fb0d1-1ee4-59c9-8810-da1377239575"))
	(text "${709c3d68-6a22-41fe-bb8f-1b3c74efa230:REFERENCE}: HV input bypass at VS; ${6584037a-df5c-481c-be6d-17e3e430d517:REFERENCE}: Reverse-polarity series diode; one per VS pins 12, 13," (at 224.58 206.424592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb33ed0b-9264-532a-9448-2017d35849e2"))
	(text "14" (at 224.58 208.964592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a793c4e0-a5d3-5948-9572-b2201ba668ed"))
	(text "${5c7b0e5f-9255-431b-ba8e-9839802417b5:REFERENCE}: Switched-rail output capacitor; one per VOUT pins 8, 9, 10" (at 224.58 211.504592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "47c655d0-297f-5ade-9486-141e2c63bab7"))
	(text "${ccedec14-0e0a-4e56-bdc4-483a87378948:REFERENCE}: ILIM programming, 40 k" (at 224.58 214.044592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d50f7548-b1b5-5017-bcb8-02e7786b948b"))
	(text "${4d9e005c-2df5-444f-86f2-c10bbc334ddf:REFERENCE}: ~{FAULT} pull-up to +3.3V_MCU, 10 k" (at 224.58 217.484592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "21f3c597-9167-57e3-b3e6-04065a238767"))
	(text "${46f86808-0f12-4b59-b5d5-64d7f6fc87f2:REFERENCE}: EN pull-down, 10 k" (at 224.58 220.024592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6da62c68-97e8-5580-afbc-9b48f3d37a90"))
	(text "${f074ca38-0248-4de7-9003-e5f54f644060:REFERENCE}: SNS sense resistor, 249 ohm" (at 224.58 222.564592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "48609bc3-26d7-55db-8a01-3237c3a67a6f"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${709c3d68-6a22-41fe-bb8f-1b3c74efa230:REFERENCE} at ${fc7d50ec-17b6-455e-92c7-d4ac9f6e233b:REFERENCE} pins 12-14 with a short return to pin 1 / the thermal pad." (at 219.5 227.644592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04c5b7d0-2daa-53d8-8fda-45b645c1686a"))
	(text "PLACE: Place ${ccedec14-0e0a-4e56-bdc4-483a87378948:REFERENCE} directly at pin 7 with a short return to GND; place ${5c7b0e5f-9255-431b-ba8e-9839802417b5:REFERENCE} at VOUT (pins 8-10) with a short return to GND. Tie the thermal pad (pin 15) to GND copper with vias; the" (at 219.5 231.454592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "34ce7378-5aea-5b65-9c12-a986e812da9a"))
	(text "pad is the heat path at the current limit." (at 219.5 233.994592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a8eddec2-62c6-5873-94c7-fde67f917b05"))
	(text "ROUTE: Short, wide copper on both ${709c3d68-6a22-41fe-bb8f-1b3c74efa230:REFERENCE} legs; it is the local reservoir for the switch's turn-on." (at 219.5 237.804592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb9ddccf-54e1-5f1a-845d-16d8073fa7e3"))
	(text "ROUTE: VS (pins 12-14) and VOUT (pins 8-10) are the PWR_HV_LOCAL current path; keep each group of pins tied together with wide copper. ILIM is a low-current Default-class node that" (at 219.5 241.614592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d20d2e80-e436-5553-94f6-9f50e41dd9c1"))
	(text "must never be left open." (at 219.5 244.154592 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5fb3755-a1bf-56bd-aa65-a4d31e799a06"))
	(polyline (pts (xy 15.24 108.326) (xy 195.24 108.326)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "0ac67824-764a-5eb1-90b3-734af8d60c91"))
